# COPY

# REGENT OF SORONG

# PROVINCE OF WEST PAPUA

# REGIONAL REGULATION OF SORONG REGENCY

# NUMBER 2 OF 2015

# CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN FROM ACTS OF VIOLENCE BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

# REGENT OF SORONG,

Considering:  
a. that violence against women and children is an act that violates the rights and dignity of women and children as human beings;  
b. that the implementation of prevention and protection of women and children as victims of violence in Sorong Regency has not been carried out optimally;  
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Protection of Women and Children from Acts of Violence;  

In View of:  
1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;  

2. Law Number 12 of 1969 concerning the Establishment of the Autonomous Province of West Irian and Autonomous Regencies in the Province of West Irian (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1969 Number 47, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 2907);  
3. Law Number 7 of 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1984 Number 699, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 368);  
4. Law Number 10 of 1992 concerning Population Development and Prosperous Family Development (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1992 Number 35, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3475);  
5. Law Number 21 of 1999 concerning Ratification of the ILO Convention Concerning Discrimination in Employment and Occupation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1992 Number 57, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3836);  
6. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);  
7. Law Number 21 of 2001 concerning Special Autonomy for Papua Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2001 Number 135, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2001 Number 4151) as amended by Law Number 35 of 2008 concerning Stipulation of Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 1 of 2008 concerning Amendment to Law Number 21 of 2001 concerning Special Autonomy for Papua Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2008 Number 112, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4884);  
8. Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);  
9. Law Number 25 of 2004 concerning the National Development Planning System (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2004 Number 104, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4421);  
10. Law Number 12 of 2011 concerning the Formulation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2011 Number 82, (Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5234);  
11. Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587), as amended by Law Number 1 of 2015 concerning Stipulation of Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 2 of 2014 concerning Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 24, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5657);  
12. Government Regulation Number 79 of 2005 concerning Guidelines for Guidance and Supervision of Regional Government Administration (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2005 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4593);  
13. Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 1 of 2014 concerning the Formulation of Regional Legal Products (State News of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 32);  
14. Regional Regulation of West Papua Province Number 11 of 2013 concerning Protection of Women and Children from Acts of Violence (Regional Gazette of West Papua Province of 2013 Number 11, Supplement to the Regional Gazette of West Papua Province Number 79);  

With the Mutual Approval of THE REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES OF SORONG REGENCY and

# REGENT OF SORONG

# HAS DECIDED:

To Establish: REGIONAL REGULATION CONCERNING THE PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN FROM ACTS OF VIOLENCE.

